        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2012 Summer Paralympics\n- Places: London, United Kingdom\n- People: Sarah Storey, David Weir, Stephanie Millward\n- Topics: Great Britain at the 2012 Summer Paralympics\n\nFacts:\n- Great Britain competed as the host nation at the 2012 Summer Paralympics in London, United Kingdom, from 29 August to 9 September 2012.\n- Sarah Storey was born on 26 October 1977.\n- Sarah Storey is a British road and track racing cyclist and former swimmer.\n- At the 2012 Summer Paralympics, Sarah Storey won four gold medals for Great Britain.\n- At the 2012 Summer Paralympics, David Weir won four gold medals for Great Britain.\n- At the 2012 Summer Paralympics, Stephanie Millward won a total of five medals for Great Britain.",
